{
  "_readme": [
    "SWD -- 剑 / 长剑系.  PHASE 01 family table: docs/weapons/WEAPON_FAMILY_TABLE.md §WPN-01.",
    "",
    "THE ROWS ARE STRUCTURAL ARCHETYPES, NOT RANDOM SEEDS.  This is the user's",
    "ruling of 2026-09-29 and it is the single most important thing about this",
    "file: a hundred weapons produced by sweeping blade_length 0.9->1.1 and",
    "guard_radius 0.12->0.16 are a hundred copies of one sword.  So each row",
    "changes a STRUCTURE -- which cross-section the blade is, whether the blade",
    "is straight or bowed and which way, where the mass sits along its length,",
    "what kind of guard it has, how long the grip is, whether it is one-handed",
    "or two -- and only then colour and material.",
    "",
    "Each row carries `world_name`, which is the corresponding entry in the",
    "family table's 扩散 10 list.  The archetype is the PRIMARY KEY because it is",
    "the thing that decides geometry; the world name is the fiction applied to",
    "it.  This is the 'Combat Family x Visual Family' model: all ten rows share",
    "the sword moveset and differ in what the player is holding, by reach, by",
    "weight class, by where the trail originates and by sheath geometry.",
    "",
    "Row 8 (relic) is the family Hero Prototype selected in the family table",
    "(D-C 遗物结构剑) -- the forge seam is a STRUCTURAL memory point that doubles",
    "as the emission channel, which is why it was chosen over the four plainer",
    "drafts.  Its row is the only one flagged tier=hero, and that flag is what",
    "routes its .blend into masters/ (Git LFS) instead of prototypes/ (ignored)."
  ],

